g\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M7</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584443\">1016A22</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the oil supply pipe to the camshaft supports (1a)  and fix\nthem tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M7</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 1.4 ÷ 1.7</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021932.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584481\">1016A26</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]